WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.013
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Online Class!

2
00:00:05.313 --> 00:00:07.792
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:08.092 --> 00:00:10.721
Unit twenty-two. Where Is It?

4
00:00:11.717 --> 00:00:15.902
Let's learn eight new words. Listen, then it's your turn to say it!

5
00:00:16.917 --> 00:00:18.080
Next to!

6
00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.064
Next to. Your turn!

7
00:00:23.964 --> 00:00:25.116
Next to!

8
00:00:25.416 --> 00:00:26.382
Great!

9
00:00:27.383 --> 00:00:28.593
Between!

10
00:00:29.493 --> 00:00:31.635
Between. Your turn!

11
00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:35.757
Between!

12
00:00:36.057 --> 00:00:36.930
Super!

13
00:00:37.917 --> 00:00:39.092
In front of!

14
00:00:39.992 --> 00:00:42.447
In front of. Your turn!

15
00:00:45.347 --> 00:00:46.661
In front of!

16
00:00:46.961 --> 00:00:47.916
Well done!

17
00:00:48.917 --> 00:00:49.778
Near!

18
00:00:50.678 --> 00:00:52.785
Near. Your turn!

19
00:00:55.685 --> 00:00:56.733
Near!

20
00:00:57.033 --> 00:00:58.069
Yes!

21
00:00:59.083 --> 00:00:59.933
Far!

22
00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:02.650
Far. Your turn!

23
00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:06.458
Far!

24
00:01:06.758 --> 00:01:07.794
Good job!

25
00:01:08.783 --> 00:01:09.970
Inside!

26
00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.058
Inside. Your turn!

27
00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:17.308
Inside!

28
00:01:17.608 --> 00:01:18.760
Wonderful!

29
00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:20.879
Outside!

30
00:01:21.779 --> 00:01:24.106
Outside. Your turn!

31
00:01:27.006 --> 00:01:28.379
Outside!

32
00:01:28.679 --> 00:01:29.726
Nice!

33
00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:31.950
Around!

34
00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:34.817
Around. Your turn!

35
00:01:37.717 --> 00:01:38.672
Around!

36
00:01:38.972 --> 00:01:39.996
Excellent!

37
00:01:40.983 --> 00:01:48.796
Next to, Next to! Between, Between, Between! In front of, In front of! Near, Near, Near!

38
00:01:49.096 --> 00:02:00.380
Far, Far, Far! Inside, Inside, Inside! Outside, Outside, Outside! Around, Around, Around!

39
00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.902
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:02:03.917 --> 00:02:14.623
Where is the kitten? It is not inside the box. Look, it is between the two chairs! Now it runs outside and around the tree. It is next to Malis now.

41
00:02:14.923 --> 00:02:17.085
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

42
00:02:18.083 --> 00:02:20.515
What is it? Can you say it?

43
00:02:23.415 --> 00:02:25.766
Between! Well done!

44
00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:29.054
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:31.954 --> 00:02:34.223
In front of! Well done!

46
00:02:35.217 --> 00:02:37.509
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:40.409 --> 00:02:42.562
Around! Well done!

48
00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.155
Let's say it together!

49
00:02:45.455 --> 00:02:49.582
The cat is between the chairs. The bag is in front of the door.

50
00:02:50.382 --> 00:02:51.325
Your turn!

51
00:02:54.825 --> 00:02:58.557
The cat is between the chairs. The bag is in front of the door.

52
00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:01.039
Who sits next to you?

53
00:03:04.339 --> 00:03:06.559
The cat is between the chairs.

54
00:03:06.859 --> 00:03:07.976
Great answer!

55
00:03:08.983 --> 00:03:12.890
Today's value is attention. Look carefully and listen well.

56
00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:15.003
I will try, Ms. Lily!

57
00:03:16.017 --> 00:03:22.584
Great job today, everyone! See you in Unit twenty-three. Bye-bye!

58
00:03:22.884 --> 00:03:24.814
Bye-bye!

